  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A Young's double slit interference arrangement with slits <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is immersed in water (refractive index <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> ) as shown in the figure. The positions of maxima on the surface of water are given by <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> , where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math> is the wavelength of light in air (refractive index = 1), <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math> is the separation between the slits and m is an integer. The value of p is<br ><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image7-02bc2b40-7a0e-4674-b456-d1e51f17fe77.png\"/></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image8-cc5ae708-aa45-4e24-92c3-2727ed6c5260.jpg\"/> <br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math> <br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math> <br > <math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math> <br > <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math> <br > <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br > <math><mo>∴</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
